  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Coronach\">Coronach</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item currently cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a> and probably should be able to be.</i></span></span>\n</p>\n<table style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #B1D3A0 solid; margin: 4px; --bg-color-1:#CCFF99;--bg-color-1-dark:#3D5F1A;--bg-color-2:var(--background-color-disabled-subtle, #D3D3D3);\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">7\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"13\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"width: 425px; background-color: #D3D3D3;\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/File:Light_Spirals_icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Light_Spirals_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br /><a href=\"/page/Light_Spirals\" title=\"Light Spirals\">Light Spirals</a>\n<table class=\"fakeClass\" style=\"width: 420px; font-weight: normal; text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Target:</th><td>Foe, Directional, Breakable</td></tr>\n<tr><th>School:</th><td>Evocation</td></tr><tr><th>Spell Resistance:</th><td>No</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Description:</th><td>Fires chaotic bolts of light that damage your enemies.  At higher charge levels multiple bolts are rapidly fired.  Opponents struck by these bolts receive a Will save for half damage.</td></tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">&#160;</th></tr>\n<tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier I:</th><td>3 to 6 &#8203; + 1</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier II:</th><td>5 to 11 &#8203; + 1 to 2 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier III:</th><td>6 to 16 &#8203; + 1 to 4 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier IV:</th><td>7 to 21 &#8203; + 1 to 6 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier V:</th><td>8 to 26 &#8203; + 1 to 8 per Artificer Level</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Required Trait\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Use\" title=\"Rune Arm Use\"> Artificer Rune Arm Use</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magical_Device\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Magical Device\">Use Magical Device</a> <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">135 / 135\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Made from\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0003500000</span>3,500<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">0.25 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Thrall_of_the_Necromancer\" title=\"Thrall of the Necromancer\">Thrall of the Necromancer</a></b>, end chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Maximum_Charge_Tier\" title=\"Maximum Charge Tier\">Maximum Charge Tier</a>: III</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Light_Spirals\" title=\"Light Spirals\">Light Spirals</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Life_Shield\" title=\"Life Shield\">Life Shield</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Life_Shield\" title=\"Life Shield\">Life Shield</a>:</b> Every time you are hit while wearing a Life Shield item there is a 10% chance you gain 15 <a href=\"/page/Temporary_hit_points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary hit points\">temporary hitpoints</a> that last for up to 1 minute.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Coronach_(enchantment)\" title=\"Coronach (enchantment)\">Coronach</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Coronach_(enchantment)\" title=\"Coronach (enchantment)\">Coronach</a>:</b> While wearing this item, your melee and ranged weapons gain Critical Hit Effect: Critical hit with this weapon will <a href=\"/page/Fascinate\" title=\"Fascinate\">fascinate</a> an undead opponent. (Will DC: 20 Negates)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span> and/or <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Light II<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Light II: Wearing this Rune Arm will imbue any weapon you wield, dealing 1d4 points of light damage per hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Craftable_Rune_Arm\" title=\"Craftable Rune Arm\">Craftable Rune Arm</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: left;\">This Rune Arm is craftable and can be customized using recipes at standard crafting devices after disjuncting.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><i>A dirge or song of lamentation of the dead</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>There is a <a href=\"/page/Item:Coronach_(historic)\" title=\"Item:Coronach (historic)\">historic version</a> of this item that had <a href=\"/page/Disrupt_Undead\" title=\"Disrupt Undead\">Disrupt Undead</a> instead of <a href=\"/page/Light_Spirals\" title=\"Light Spirals\">Light Spirals</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>Disjuncted version:<br />\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Coronach_disjuncted.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Coronach_disjuncted.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"438\" height=\"703\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Coronach.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Coronach.png/420px-Coronach.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"660\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Coronach.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817040051\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.145 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5680/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41655/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10926/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 33/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  122.385      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  122.385      1 -total\n 94.40%  115.529      1 Template:Named_Rune_Arm\n 68.11%   83.362     64 Template:IO\n 24.55%   30.040      1 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 23.05%   28.206      1 Template:IsLamannia\n 21.58%   26.415      1 Template:IsSpeculation\n 19.47%   23.828      1 Template:InCategory\n 17.70%   21.666      8 Template:Popup\n 17.30%   21.176      2 Template:Non-food\n-->\